{"id":"tag-food-truck-catering-minneapolis-page-1","path":"/tag/food-truck-catering-minneapolis/","title":"Food truck catering Minneapolis Archives - Minnesnowii Shave Ice","description":"","robots":"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1","ogTitle":"Food truck catering Minneapolis Archives","ogDescription":"","ogImage":"https://minnesnowii.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Artboard-1@2x.png","twitterCard":"summary_large_image","jsonLdCount":1,"text":"BOOK US TODAY!  (952) 486-0079\nPrimary Menu\nSkip to content\nJobs\nBlog\nFun With Shave Ice\nEvent and Party Catering\nIn The News\nWall Street Journal\n\nJason Giandalia, Interviewed in the Wall Street Journal. Read it below:   https://www.wsj.com/articles/its-not-you-its-millennials-rhode-island-dumps-hot-wieners-for-craft-beer-1497096001… Read More\n\nWhy we call it “Shave ice” and not Shaved ice…\n\nShave ice, a popular frozen treat that originated in Japan, has been enjoyed around the world for its unique texture and refreshing taste. While the dessert is commonly referred to as “shaved ice” in many parts of the world, it is spelled as “shave ice” in Hawaii, where it has become a local specialty. The… Read More\n\nGive Me The Mike and KSTP’s Twin Cities Live at The Minnesota State Fair!\n\nCheck out this VIDEO when the crew from KSTP’s Give Me The Mike and Twin Cities Live stopped by! Which one is your favorite?  … Read More\n\nShout out from EATER\n\nThank you for the shout out EATER! Check out some of their suggestions on what to eat at the MINNESOTA STATE FAIR:   EATER LINK HERE   What’s your favorite on this list?… Read More\n\nJason Derusha from WCCO Stops by to make some shave ice!\n\nCheck out Jason Derusha from WCCO stop by our location at the Minnesota State Fair to make some shave ice! How do you think he did?    … Read More\n\nMpls St Paul Business Magazine\n\nThank you for the shout out MPLS ST PAUL MAGAZINE! https://mspmag.com/locations/minnesnowii-authentic-hawai/… Read More\n\nVoted Best Minnesota State Fair Food Vendor from the Star Tribune!\n\nExcited to share this voted Minnesota’s best award from the Star Tribune! Thank you to everyone who voted for us! This truly means a lot! None of this would be possible without all the support from my family, friends, staff and their wonderful families year after year! Voting for this year will be underway soon!… Read More\n\nYes, we cater all events!\n\nSummer just got sweeter with catering from MinneSnowii Shave Ice! Say goodbye to boring events and hello to refreshing, flavorful fun! Whether you’re celebrating a graduation party, birthday party, wedding reception, or corporate event, our shave ice is the perfect addition to add a little chill to your event. We handle private events of all… Read More\n\nInfo on the ice\n\nIf you’re looking for a refreshing and tasty treat to beat the heat, look no further than Hawaiian shave ice. Also known as shave ice or simply “shaved ice,” this delicious dessert has been a favorite in Hawaii for generations, and for good reason. What is Hawaiian Shave Ice? Hawaiian shave ice is a dessert… Read More\n\nKick Off To Summer at the Minnesota State Fair\n\nWe all know that the Minnesota State Fair got canceled last year and the cravings for all those fair foods are going wild!  No need to worry, you don’t have to wait until August to enjoy all that good food.  The Kick Off to Summer event at the fair is helping to satisfy those cravings… Read More\n\npaging-navigation\n1\n2\n3\nDAYS\n0\n0\n0\nHOURS\n0\n0\nMINUTES\n0\n0\nSECONDS\n0\n0\nJoin us at the MN State Fair!\n\n\nAcross from the GIANT SLIDE!\n\n\n\n6100 Mccoll Dr Unit 381\nSavage MN\nBook Us Today!\n(952) 486-0079\n  \nEvent and Party Catering\nFun With Shave Ice\nIn The Media\nBlog\nJobs\nRochester\nHome\n\n\n\n© 2026 Minnesnowii. All rights reserved. Favicon by Flaticon. Site design by Stargazer LLC.","links":["tel:9524860079","https://www.facebook.com/MinneSnowii/","https://twitter.com/Minn